[40.268672, "o", "Help on function input in module bytewax.operators:\r\n\r\ninput(step_id: str, flow: bytewax.dataflow.Dataflow, source: bytewax.inputs.Source[~X]) -> bytewax.dataflow.Stream[~X]\r\n    Introduce items into a dataflow.\r\n\r\n    ```{testcode}\r\n    from bytewax.dataflow import Dataflow\r\n    import bytewax.operators as op\r\n    from bytewax.testing import TestingSource\r\n\r\n    flow = Dataflow(\"input_eg\")\r\n    nums = op.input(\"nums\", flow, TestingSource([10, 20, 30]))\r\n    op.inspect(\"out\", nums)\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n    ```{testcode}\r\n    :hide:\r\n    from bytewax.testing import run_main\r\n"]
